{{Quote|text=I want to go out and play with Jas and Vincent. I have important studies today though... Maybe this weekend.}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a child with magical abilities. Once the player has at least 3 hearts with the wizard, they will enter the game in year 3 and become the wizard's pupil.

Morgan is a young mage who is assigned to Magnus as a new pupil. They come from the town of Everton, somewhere in the mountains north of Pelican Town. Morgan is a curious child, torn between their duty to study and learn to protect people, and the desire to just be a kid. 

